1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,991
Vanuatu: five things you must never do.

2
00:00:03,511 --> 00:00:03,738
One.

3
00:00:03,758 --> 00:00:06,271
Don't walk through a village in swimwear.

4
00:00:06,791 --> 00:00:07,018
Two.

5
00:00:07,038 --> 00:00:09,670
Don't take photos
of people without asking.

6
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:10,643
Three.

7
00:00:10,663 --> 00:00:15,920
Don't step onto a tabu site,
or someone's land, without permission.

8
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:16,756
Four.

9
00:00:16,776 --> 00:00:18,573
Don't be loud at a nakamal.

10
00:00:18,593 --> 00:00:20,120
Kava is drunk in quiet.

11
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:20,945
Five.

12
00:00:20,965 --> 00:00:25,171
Don't board any boat or minibus
without checking that it is safe.

13
00:00:25,691 --> 00:00:28,358
Follow these, and Vanuatu
will welcome you.

